{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WRBViJfVKocaThFQkyPc5V","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Meridian Works: short purchasing guide (lossy by design)\n2\t\n3\t- Up to $2,500 in routine spending: manager; above $2,500: manager plus finance.\n4\t- Emergencies up to $5,000: finance preapproval waived and manager approves.\n5\t- Travel: airfare above $800 requires travel-office approval.\n6\t- Prohibited vendors need compliance authorization.\n7\t- Before July 2025, the routine threshold was $2,000.\n8\t\n9\tThis brief deliberately omits some conditions, timing distinctions, and cross-references. Full text remains under reference/ and controls if consulted.\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0ba0ab3-d2b3-4cf0-b09d-661e49de1659","uuid":"76f93d94-175e-4564-b7e7-cb0122701e72","timestamp":"2026-10-13T19:25:14.466Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\paradox-sessions-20261013\\DH_FRESH_01\\H4\\SUMMARY.md","content":"# Meridian Works: short purchasing guide (lossy by design)\n\n- Up to $2,500 in routine spending: manager; above $2,500: manager plus finance.\n- Emergencies up to $5,000: finance preapproval waived and manager approves.\n- Travel: airfare above $800 requires travel-office approval.\n- Prohibited vendors need compliance authorization.\n- Before July 2025, the routine threshold was $2,000.\n\nThis brief deliberately omits some conditions, timing distinctions, and cross-references. Full text remains under reference/ and controls if consulted.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}}}
